 <h3><u>Haider haider haider haider</u></h3> 
 <div style=width:100%> 
  <p></p>
  <p>HAIDER HAIDER HAIDER HAIDER..(4)</p> 
  <p>Shere Khuda, Daamade Payamber<br> HAIDER HAIDER HAIDER HAIDER</p> 
  <p>Shafae Mehshar, Sakiye Kausar<br> HAIDER HAIDER HAIDER HAIDER</p> 
  <p>1. Bolna maine jab seekha tha, maa ne meri ye mujhse kaha tha..(2)<br> Bolo beta jaan laga kar..(2)<br> HAIDER HAIDER HAIDER HAIDER</p> 
  <p>2. Meri wasiyat yaad ye rakhna, qabr ke bahar tum sab kehna..(2)<br> Khud mai kahunga qabr ke andar..(2)<br> HAIDER HAIDER HAIDER HAIDER</p> 
  <p>3. Wakif the aadabe wila se, kalma adhura kaise padhte..(2)<br> Daste nabi par bole kankar…<br> Haider Haider Haider Haider</p> 
  <p>4. Shabbar aur shabbir ho raazi, sehwan wala peer ho raazi..(2)<br> Bolo sakhi shahbaaz qalandar..(2)<br> Haider Haider Haider Haider</p> 
  <p>5. Dono hai ye roohe wilayat, dono hai ye jaane wilayat..(2)<br> Allaho akbar Allaho akbar..(2)<br> Haider Haider Haider Haider</p> 
  <p>6. Zikre Ali par paabandi thi, lekin Zainab aise boli..(2)<br> Goonj utha darbaar ke andar..(2)<br> HAIDER HAIDER HAIDER HAIDER</p> 
  <p>7. Usko laga rehta hai khatra, bigda hua hai jiska shajra..(2)<br> Aa nahi sakta uski zabaa par..(2)<br> HAIDER HAIDER HAIDER HAIDER</p> 
  <p>8. Doobne waali thi jab kashti, Nuh ne aakhir kisko sadaa di..(2)<br> Bas ye sadaa thi Nuh ke lab par..(2)<br> HAIDER HAIDER HAIDER HAIDER</p> 
  <p>9. Meesum se ye mujhko mili hai, maine kitaabe ishq padhi hai..(2)<br> Pehla sabak hai uske andar..(2)<br> HAIDER HAIDER HAIDER HAIDER</p> 
  <p>10. Chehre ko dhaake aae Ghaazi, Siffeen me aisi jung ladi thi..(2)<br> Ran me sadaa thi ye to wahi hai..(2)<br> HAIDER HAIDER HAIDER HAIDER</p> 
  <p>11. Hasi ka aisa teer chala tha, laakho ka lashkar mar hi gaya tha..(2)<br> Pote aakhir kiske hai Asghar..(2)<br> HAIDER HAIDER HAIDER HAIDER</p> 
  <p>12. Maut se darta hai na daraa hai, ishq ‘Takallum’ bol raha hai..(2)<br> Daar ke upar zere khanjar..(2)<br> HAIDER HAIDER HAIDER HAIDER</p> 
